                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "I loved this professor. Whenever I had a question he was very willing and available to answer. He is very obviously knowledgeable in his subject. He spent a lot of the course making mini-assignments that led up to the final paper at the end, which was very helpful. The class was discussion based with a lot of readings but was still very manageable",
